        "url": "https://tidewater.example/",
        "title": "Tidewater Coffee Roasters \u00b7 Small-batch coffee, roasted by the sea",
        "text": "<head><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1F4E5F\"><style>:root{--tide:#1F4E5F;--sand:#F4EFE6;--ember:#C8553D} .btn{background:#C8553D;color:#F4EFE6}</style></head>\n<h1>Small-batch coffee, roasted by the sea</h1>\n<p>Tidewater Coffee Roasters is a two-person roastery on the Oregon coast. We roast twice a week in 12-kilo batches and ship within 48 hours of the roast.</p>\n<h2>For people who brew at home</h2>\n<p>Our subscribers get a new single-origin bag every two weeks, with a card on how we brew it. No jargon, no scores out of 100: just what it tastes like and how to make it taste that way.</p>\n<p>Visit the roastery on Saturdays for a free cupping, 10 to noon.</p>\n<footer>Tidewater Coffee Roasters \u00b7 hello@tidewater.example</footer>"
      },
